ystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">亏损超80亿、算力承诺546亿:Anthropic招股书揭开大模型顶流的真实账本</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI联合红帽与英伟达研发OCE1.0，打造面向AI代理的企业级Kubernetes</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">AMD CEO苏姿丰下月将访韩，拟与三星电子敲定HBM4内存供应合作</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌向免费用户开放 Gemini Skills，Gems 功能将于 11 月完成整合</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3dd79068710eb030bec9c04638f92175.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌正式宣布将此前仅限 Pro 和 Ultra 付费订阅的 Gemini Skills 自定义指令服务全面向免费用户开放。此次更新旨在降低个性化 AI 的使用门槛，提升 Gemini 在大众市场的用户粘性。伴随该调整，原有的 Gems 功能将于 2026 年 11 月 17 日自动过渡整合至升级后的 Skills 系统中。升级后的 Skills 保留了原有的自定义配置能力，并优化了底层交互逻辑，用户在主聊天框输入“/”加指令即可唤醒特定 AI 技能。系统迁移期间，用户可保留既有配置，并通过专属链接创建新 Skills，实现无缝过渡。此举标志着谷歌进一步强化了 Gemini 平台的个性化交互体验，通过技术普惠化提升整体平台竞争力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软联手哈佛MIT发布生物学世界模型Project Quine，实现抗癌药物快速筛选</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/049dadf42e5f697b56c1bd53c8e01875.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软研究院联合哈佛大学及麻省理工学院博德研究所，正式推出生物学世界模型Project Quine。该系统旨在打通计算生物学建模与湿实验流程，通过构建覆盖基因组学、蛋白质、化学分子、细胞状态及生物成像的联合表征空间，实现多模态信息的综合推理与跨领域分析。Project Quine的核心优势在于其交互式推理框架，能够解决传统药物发现中多领域数据难以统一的瓶颈。在实际测试中，该系统展现出极高效率，仅用一个周末即筛选出抗癌候选物，将药物筛选与验证周期从数月压缩至数天。这一进展大幅降低了科研成本，并为发现全新治疗路径提供了可能。目前，微软已启动首届Quine Fellows项目，开放科研人员申请抢先使用，后续计划通过产品化路径逐步拓展至商业化场景，推动AI技术在生命科学领域的深度应用。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">亏损超80亿、算力承诺546亿:Anthropic招股书揭开大模型顶流的真实账本</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ab7742c19edc16283651a5f2488dbbf0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">亏损超80亿、算力承诺546亿:Anthropic招股书揭开大模型顶流的真实账本AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Sep 30, 202636Anthropic近日向部分合作伙伴披露其IPO招股说明书，计划以约2万亿美元的目标估值推进上市。数据显示，公司2025年营收同比增长12倍至近46亿美元，近三分之二来自美国市场，但同期运营亏损亦翻倍突破80亿美元。在商业化结构上，Claude模型以用量计费为主导，贡献约38亿美元收入，订阅业务仅实现7.89亿美元（占比不足20%）。招股书清晰显现出其对头部科技巨头的深度绑定:2025年，Anthropic通过亚马逊和谷歌云平台斩获21.6亿美元收入，营收占比由2023年的11%大幅攀升至47%，并为此支付约3.51亿美元渠道抽成。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI联合红帽与英伟达研发OCE1.0，打造面向AI代理的企业级Kubernetes</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2cb8beb2512d5a53b38af86ce5743167.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI、红帽（Red Hat）与英伟达正联合开发开源智能体框架的企业级版本OpenClaw Enterprise（OCE1.0），旨在解决AI代理在企业环境中的安全与合规难题。该项目由OpenAI内部发起并捐赠给OpenClaw基金会，被定位为“面向代理的Kubernetes”。针对此前OpenClaw因安全机制薄弱被Gartner定性为高风险的问题，OCE1.0引入了企业级控制平面，原生支持多租户隔离、严苛的安全边界控制及标准化代理原语，并提供完善的治理与可审计性。该框架允许企业灵活替换底层模型、框架及沙箱方案。红帽副总裁Joe Fernandes强调，OCE1.0旨在推动AI智能体从消费端探索迈向生产力基础设施，为企业在确保系统安全的前提下部署高自主性AI代理提供了关键路径，标志着智能体生态进入注重合</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">AMD CEO苏姿丰下月将访韩，拟与三星电子敲定HBM4内存供应合作</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4913ccd3981ba570d2bd86e12ae78ac2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">AMD CEO苏姿丰计划于下月亲赴韩国，与三星电子高层举行会谈，核心议题聚焦于AI芯片技术合作，旨在将三星纳入AMD下一代AI加速器HBM4的内存供应链。双方此前已于今年3月签署围绕AI存储芯片与计算技术的谅解备忘录，三星被视为HBM4芯片的优先供应商。此次访问若能达成实质性订单，将直接决定AMD未来旗舰AI加速器的产能保障与交付节奏。除三星外，苏姿丰此行还计划接触韩国本土NPU企业并与相关CEO会面，意在通过强化内存供应绑定及拓展专用计算单元合作，进一步完善AMD在AI算力产业链的战略布局。HBM4作为AI加速器的关键内存层级，其供应稳定性对AMD应对AI市场竞争至关重要。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
